Now write drawKaminoOcean and drawKaminoBridges. Design details:

drawKaminoOcean(ctx, w, h, S, rng, pathPts):
- soft storm light radial in upper-right.
- Long swell lines: use bezier arcs across width, ~26 lines, with gradient stroke? canvas strokeStyle per line rgba.
- wave crest highlights: small white dashes.
- dark swell shadows big ellipses.
- distant rain haze bands in background (static subtle) — animated rain added later.
- avoid path area (distanceToPath > 30*S) for clutter.

Implementation:

```js
function drawKaminoOcean(ctx, w, h, S, rng, pathPts) {
  ctx.save();
  // rolling swell bands
  ctx.lineCap = 'round';
  for (let i = 0; i < 26; i++) {
    const y = rng() * h;
    const x = rng() * w;
    if (distanceToPath(x, y, pathPts) < 34 * S) continue;
    const len = (90 + rng() * 260) * S;
    const amp = (4 + rng() * 10) * S;
    ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(140, 205, 232, ${0.04 + rng() * 0.07})`;
    ctx.lineWidth = (1 + rng() * 3.4) * S;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(x - len * 0.5, y);
    ctx.bezierCurveTo(x - len * 0.2, y - amp, x + len * 0.2, y + amp, x + len * 0.5, y);
    ctx.stroke();
  }
  // deep troughs
  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {
    const x = rng() * w, y = rng() * h;
    const rx = (120 + rng() * 220) * S, ry = rx * (0.18 + rng()*0.18);
    const g = ctx.createRadialGradient(x, y, 0, x, y, rx);
    g.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(2, 8, 16, 0.24)');
    g.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(2, 8, 16, 0)');
    ctx.fillStyle = g;
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(x, y, rx, ry, (rng()-0.5)*0.3, 0, TAU); ctx.fill();
  }
  // whitecaps
  for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) {
    const x = rng()*w, y = rng()*h;
    if (distanceToPath(x,y,pathPts) < 30*S) continue;
    const len = (3 + rng()*10) * S;
    ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(210, 240, 252, ${0.06 + rng()*0.14})`;
    ctx.lineWidth = (0.6 + rng()*1.1)*S;
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x,y); ctx.lineTo(x+len, y - (rng()*1.5)*S); ctx.stroke();
  }
  // storm glow near horizon top-right
  const glow = ctx.createRadialGradient(w*0.82, -h*0.1, 0, w*0.82, -h*0.1, Math.max(w,h)*0.8);
  glow.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(142, 214, 245, 0.20)');
  glow.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(96, 172, 214, 0.06)');
  glow.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(96, 172, 214, 0)');
  ctx.fillStyle = glow; ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);
  ctx.restore();
}
```

drawKaminoBridges(ctx, w, h, S, pathPts, pw, pads):
- Underwater shadow: stroke path offset +6*S, width pw+26, rgba(0,10,20,.55).
